        <mxCell id="d2" value="&lt;b&gt;🗺️ Google Maps Platform API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Google Maps SDK: Render peta dasar interaktif&lt;br&gt;• Geocoding API: Konversi titik lokasi&lt;br&gt;• Directions API: Panduan navigasi rute jalan riil kampus-kos" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FDE68A;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="t3">
